{
    "background_story": "Lilith was a majestic mare with a gentle soul. She was part of an equine therapy program at a local rehabilitation center, where she helped people with physical and emotional disabilities. Her calm demeanor and soothing presence made her a favorite among the patients. As they groomed, rode, or simply spent time with her, Lilith seemed to sense their deepest needs. She would nuzzle those who were anxious, provide a comforting presence for those who were grieving, and even offer a playful spark for those who needed to laugh. The therapists credited Lilith with helping their patients make breakthroughs, build confidence, and find peace. Her therapeutic touch was a gift, and those who knew her were forever changed by her loving and compassionate spirit.",
